:::text id=txt_s2 at=top-left width=300 height=240 offsetX=489 offsetY=330 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=16
**Step 2: Shared Understanding**  
Build Shared understanding of the problem and its impact on the business, product, or team.
:::

:::shape id=card_s3 at=top-left width=350 height=340 offsetX=850 offsetY=260 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

